OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FPartly cloudy to start, mostly
OL,6,Fdry but with a few showers over the
OL,7,FPennines. Cloud building through the
OL,8,Fday, with the odd spot of rain
OL,9,Fpossible anywhere. More persistent
OL,10,Frain arrives across Northumberland
OL,11,Flate in the afternoon.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FWidely cloudy with rain,
OL,14,Fmoving south-eastwards across the
OL,15,Fregion through the evening and
OL,16,Fovernight with potentially the odd
OL,17,Fheavier burst in places. Cloudy and
OL,18,Fdamp into Wednesday. Turning muggy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
