OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FBecoming wet through the
OL,6,Fmorning with heavy rain leading to
OL,7,Fpoor driving conditions by late
OL,8,Fmorning and afternoon. Rain easing but
OL,9,Fwidely grey and damp into the evening.
OL,10,FFeeling cooler.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,13,FRemaining unsettled, a brighter day
OL,14,Fwith isolated showers on Thursday,
OL,15,Fahead of further heavy rain into
OL,16,FFriday. Turning drier through Friday
OL,17,Finto Saturday. Temperatures near
OL,18,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
